[61.848172, "o", "evt-00039|4624|DC01.corp.example|-|WEC$|3|An account was successfully logged on.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-0-0\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\t-\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\t-\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x0\r\r\n\r\r\nLogon Information:\r\r\n\tLogon Type:\t\t3\r\r\n\tRestricted Admin Mode:\t-\r\r\n\tVirtual Account:\t\tNo\r\r\n\tElevated Token:\t\tYes\r\r\n\r\r\nImpersonation Level:\t\tDelegation\r\r\n\r\r\nNew Logon:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2253742117-2054739524-205962475-1111\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWEC$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP.LOCAL\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x578CA4F\r\r\n\tLinked Logon ID:\t\t0x0\r\r\n\tNetwork Account Name:\t-\r\r\n\tNetwork Account Domain:\t-\r\r\n\tLogon GUID:\t\t{e9005592-3c39-e94d-f422-b4e34dcd17a4}\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t\t0x0\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\t\t-\r\r\n\r\r\nNetwork Information:\r\r\n\tWorkstation Name:\t-\r\r\n\tSource Network Address:\t172.18.38.6\r\r\n\tSource Port:\t\t58087\r\r\n\r\r\nDetailed Authentication Information:\r\r\n\tLogon Process:\t\tKerberos\r\r\n\tAuthentication Package:\tKerberos\r\r\n\tTransited Services:\t-\r\r\n\tPackage Name (NTLM only):\t-\r\r\n\tKey Length:\t\t0\r\r\n\r\r\nThis event is generated when a logon session is created. It is generated on the computer that was accessed.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe subject fields indicate the account on the local system which requested the logon. This is most commonly a service such as the Server service, or a local process such as Winlogon.exe or Services.exe.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe logon type field indicates the kind of logon that occurred. The most common types are 2 (interactive) and 3 (network).\r\r\n\r\r\nThe New Logon fields indicate the account for whom the new logon was created, i.e. the account that was logged on.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe network fields indicate where a remote logon request originated. Workstation name is not always available and may be left blank in some cases.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe impersonation level field indicates the extent to which a process in the logon session can impersonate.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe authentication information fields provide detailed information about this specific logon request.\r\r\n\t- Logon GUID is a unique identifier that can be used to correlate this event with a KDC event.\r\r\n\t- Transited services indicate which intermediate services have part\r\nevt-00041|5140|DC01.corp.example|WEC$|||A network share object was accessed.\r\r\n\t\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2253742117-2054739524-205962475-1111\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWEC$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x578CA4F\r\r\n\r\r\nNetwork Information:\t\r\r\n\tObject Type:\t\tFile\r\r\n\tSource Address:\t\t172.18.38.6\r\r\n\tSource Port:\t\t58087\r\r\n\t\r\r\nShare Information:\r\r\n\tShare Name:\t\t\\\\*\\IPC$\r\r\n\tShare Path:\t\t\r\r\n\r\r\nAccess Request Information:\r\r\n\tAccess Mask:\t\t0x1\r\r\n\tAccesses:\t\tReadData (or ListDirectory)\r\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\r\n\r\nevt-00042|5145|DC01.corp.example|WEC$|||A network share object was checked to see whether client can be granted desired access.\r\r\n\t\r\r\nSubject:\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2253742117-2054739524-205962475-1111\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWEC$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x578CA4F\r\r\n\r\r\nNetwork Information:\t\r\r\n\tObject Type:\t\tFile\r\r\n\tSource Address:\t\t172.18.38.6\r\r\n\tSource Port:\t\t58087\r\r\n\t\r\r\nShare Information:\r\r\n\tShare Name:\t\t\\\\*\\IPC$\r\r\n\tShare Path:\t\t\r\r\n\tRelative Target Name:\tsamr\r\r\n\r\r\nAccess Request Information:\r\r\n\tAccess Mask:\t\t0x12019F\r\r\n\tAccesses:\t\tREAD_CONTROL\r\r\n\t\t\t\tSYNCHRONIZE\r\r\n\t\t\t\tReadData (or ListDirectory)\r\r\n\t\t\t\tWriteData (or AddFile)\r\r\n\t\t\t\tAppendData (or AddSubdirectory or CreatePipeInstance)\r\r\n\t\t\t\tReadEA\r\r\n\t\t\t\tWriteEA\r\r\n\t\t\t\tReadAttributes\r\r\n\t\t\t\tWriteAttributes\r\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\r\nAccess Check Results:\r\r\n\t-\r\r\n\r\nevt-00043|4661|DC01.corp.example|WEC$|||A handle to an object was requested.\r\r\n\r\r\nSubject :\r\r\n\tSecurity ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2253742117-2054739524-205962475-1111\r\r\n\tAccount Name:\t\tWEC$\r\r\n\tAccount Domain:\t\tCORP\r\r\n\tLogon ID:\t\t0x578CA4F\r\r\n\r\r\nObject:\r\r\n\tObject Server:\tSecurity Account Manager\r\r\n\tObject Type:\tSAM_DOMAIN\r\r\n\tObject Name:\tDC=mordor,DC=local\r\r\n\tHandle ID:\t0x28a7b844310\r\r\n\r\r\nProcess Information:\r\r\n\tProcess ID:\t0x2c0\r\r\n\tProcess Name:\tC:\\Windows\\System32\\lsass.exe\r\r\n\r\r\nAccess Request Information:\r\r\n\tTransaction ID:\t{00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000}\r\r\n\tAccesses:\tREAD_CONTROL\r\r\n\t\t\t\tReadOtherParameters\r\r\n\t\t\t\tCreateUser\r\r\n\t\t\t\tGetLocalGroupMembership\r\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\r\n\tAccess Reasons:\t\t-\r\r\n\tAccess Mask:\t0x20094\r\r\n\tPrivileges Used for Access Check:\t-\r\r\n\tProperties:\t---\r\r\n\t{19195a5a-6da0-11d0-afd3-00c04fd930c9}\r\r\nREAD_CONTROL\r\r\nReadOtherParameters\r\r\nCreateUser\r\r\nGetLocalGroupMembership\r\r\n\t\t{c7407360-20bf-11d0-a768-00aa006e0529}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679a4-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679a5-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679a6-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679bb-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679c2-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679c3-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967a09-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967a0b-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t{b8119fd0-04f6-4762-ab7a-4986c76b3f9a}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967a34-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967a33-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679c5-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967a61-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf967977-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf96795e-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t\t{bf9679ea-0de6-11d0-a285-00aa003049e2}\r\r\n\t\t{ab721a52-1e2f-11d0-9819-00aa0040529b}\r\r\n\r\r\n\tRestricted SID Count:\t0\r\nevt-00044|4661|DC01.corp.example|WEC$|||A handle to an obj